1
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:06,520
The Summary tab gives you an overview of your accounts and positions.

2
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:10,880
At the top, each account shows its balance, equity, margin and profit.

3
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:15,740
Below, open positions are added up per instrument, with Buy and Sell on separate rows.

4
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:19,910
The title shows what is being summed, and the total profit or loss.

5
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:22,620
Right-click to change what is summed.

6
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:29,400
Overall counts every open position. Day and Shift count only today's, or this shift's.

7
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:37,430
The title now says Day.

8
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:41,450
Not hedged summary only hides positions that are covered by an opposite position.

9
00:00:41,550 --> 00:00:46,370
Our Buy and Sell cover each other, so both rows are hidden.

10
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:50,180
Right-click the list and choose it again to show every row.

11
00:00:50,280 --> 00:00:55,900
Events and Messages lists what happened: orders, positions and messages from your broker.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:59,760
Click an event to read its details below.

13
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:04,620
Risk Exposure shows how much of each currency you hold. Here the Buy and Sell cancel out.

14
00:01:04,720 --> 00:01:10,840
Export CSV saves a list as a spreadsheet file. You are asked to confirm first.

